'''Windburst''' (暴風林, ''Bōfūrin'', '''Windstorm Forest''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]].

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (L): Knockback distance increases by 30%.

