==Trivia==
*This [[Cat Combo]]'s Japanese name, Bōfūrin (暴風林), directly translates to "Windstorm Forest", but also sounds like 防風林, which means "windbreak forest" and is the Japanese word for [[wikipedia:Shelterbelt|shelterbelt]]. The only difference is that the Combo's name spells ''bōfū'' as 暴風 ("windstorm") rather than 防風 ("windbreak").

